<title>USA: Federated Department Q3 shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Federated Department Q3 shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit	     $  0.20     loss     $  0.24</p>
<p> Net profit		41,801     loss	46,395</p>
<p> Revs		   3,609,148		3,748,369</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     207,820		  197,017</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		$   0.11     loss    $   0.91</p>
<p> Net loss		  23,338     loss     170,320</p>
<p> Revs		  10,194,041		9,783,624</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     207,398		  187,508</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>First Call Mean Estimate $0.32 per share.</p>
<p>Full name Federated Department Stores Inc.</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 net includes pre-tax charge of 44.3 million for costs of merger with Broadway Stores Inc. Before charge, 1996 Q3 net profit of $68.7 million or $0.33 per share.</p>
<p>1995 Q3 net includes a pre-tax charge of $39.1 million for costs of merger with Macy's. Before charge, Q3 1995 net loss of $22.6 million or $0.12 per share.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
